OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely fine
OL,6,Fand dry overnight, with winds easing
OL,7,Fto become light. Although the odd
OL,8,Fisolated light shower cannot be ruled
OL,9,Fout at first. Largely clear skies
OL,10,Fdeveloping towards dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FFine and dry, with light winds
OL,13,Fand some patchy fair weather cloud
OL,14,Fdeveloping through the day. Becoming
OL,15,Fcloudier overnight, with a
OL,16,Fstrengthening breeze. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear normal for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
