OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fand low cloud into Monday, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Drier Monday afternoon with
OL,8,Ffurther rain Tuesday morning and a
OL,9,Fdeveloping moderate to fresh breeze.
OL,10,FDrier thereafter but remaining windy.
